#lets create our workspace
  #this will show all the workspace related command 
  terraform workspace 
  #lst the workspace which show default
  terraform workspace list
  ##lets create our dev workspace
  terraform workspace new dev
  ##lets apply the infra in dev workspace using dev.tfvars file
  terraform apply --var-file=dev.tfvars
  ########################################
  1. check the vpc is created with dev and vpc series showing 10.10.0.0 series
  2. check the subnet it is creted with 10.10 series
  3. check two instance create with t2.micro
  ###lets create the prod namespace
  terraform workspace new prod
  terraform workspace list
  ###lets apply it in prod workspace
  terraform apply --var-file=prod.tfvars
  ###check 
  1. now you have another vpc with prod
  2. subnet with prod
  3. two more instance with prod and size will be different
  4. check the lb now you have two lb one is for dev another for prod
  
